WEBVTT

00:02.419 --> 00:05.505
Let's strengthen the unity
between the military and the Temple.

00:05.588 --> 00:10.385
Such a bond will lead humanity to victory.

00:10.969 --> 00:12.262
Uncle...

00:13.930 --> 00:17.517
Your ambition truly inspires me.

00:20.103 --> 00:23.398
May the blessings
of Saint Mahaeyzel be with us.

00:26.025 --> 00:27.986
All right, we're switching
from defense to offense.

00:37.996 --> 00:38.913
Uncle.

00:40.206 --> 00:43.376
I'd like to get more accurate info.

00:44.085 --> 00:46.546
Which unit discovered

00:46.629 --> 00:47.839
the faerie invasion?

00:47.922 --> 00:51.551
It was the Ioff City
Defense Force Unit 7110.

00:52.260 --> 00:54.512
Some of them barely survived,

00:54.596 --> 00:56.556
but none of them can speak now.

00:57.807 --> 00:59.059
I understand.

00:59.934 --> 01:01.019
I'll see you later then.

01:09.319 --> 01:12.405
The infiltration route has been secured.

01:12.489 --> 01:15.241
I'll return to my post too.

01:26.127 --> 01:27.837
Prepare to intercept.

01:27.921 --> 01:31.216
Sniper Lieutenant Siena,
it's up to you to stop them.

01:31.299 --> 01:32.926
Cavalry Lieutenant Zofflec.

01:33.802 --> 01:35.345
We are ready here.

01:35.845 --> 01:37.347
Everyone!

01:37.430 --> 01:38.765
Commence firing!

01:43.269 --> 01:44.395
Amazing!

01:47.941 --> 01:49.025
Now!

01:49.109 --> 01:50.527
Break through them!

01:56.324 --> 01:59.202
After them! Kill any faeries that escape!

01:59.285 --> 02:00.912
Hurry up and suppress them!

02:00.995 --> 02:01.955
Yes, sir!

02:04.415 --> 02:05.875
Not bad.

02:05.959 --> 02:08.795
Let's leave this to the Holy Knights.

02:10.213 --> 02:14.008
We must hurry and find
Demon Lord Spriggan.

03:57.612 --> 03:58.905
Tatsuya, go!

04:26.599 --> 04:27.558
It's a new faerie!

04:27.642 --> 04:28.476
It's humanoid!

04:28.559 --> 04:29.936
Are they fighting among themselves?

04:30.019 --> 04:32.480
We're humans! Open the door quickly!

04:33.189 --> 04:34.232
Humans...?

04:35.817 --> 04:38.528
That sacred seal... aren't you a penal hero?

04:38.611 --> 04:40.154
Hurry up!

04:40.238 --> 04:42.615
Faerie reinforcements are coming!

04:42.699 --> 04:44.117
You guys want to die here or what?

04:45.326 --> 04:48.329
You can't last long hiding in there!

04:48.413 --> 04:50.581
Xylo, you cannot act like this.

04:51.291 --> 04:53.793
Civilians!

04:57.797 --> 04:58.881
Civilians,

04:58.965 --> 05:00.842
I am Teoritta, the Goddess.

05:00.925 --> 05:02.885
I have come to save you.

05:02.969 --> 05:04.929
Please cooperate with us right now!

05:05.013 --> 05:07.056
That's right, civilians.

05:07.140 --> 05:10.101
This warehouse is currently
in great danger.

05:10.184 --> 05:12.729
However, please rest assured.

05:12.812 --> 05:15.690
The Shining Goddess of Swords,
Lady Teoritta,

05:15.773 --> 05:17.233
and the Thunder Falcon,

05:17.317 --> 05:19.902
- Xylo Forbartz, have arrived.
- Tch.

05:19.986 --> 05:21.237
The Goddess?

05:21.321 --> 05:23.197
Thunder Falcon? That's...

05:23.281 --> 05:24.115
Could it be...

05:24.198 --> 05:26.534
- Hey, wait!
- Oh...

05:26.617 --> 05:28.619
Who are you calling "Thunder Falcon"?

05:28.703 --> 05:31.622
I heard about it
in the punishment room too.

05:31.706 --> 05:33.791
I heard you're quite popular
under that name.

05:33.875 --> 05:35.168
You jerk, what are you--

05:35.251 --> 05:37.670
Xylo, what does it matter?

05:37.754 --> 05:41.507
The Shining Goddess of Swords
and the Thunder Falcon.

05:42.467 --> 05:45.553
They sound like two great heroes...

05:59.734 --> 06:01.944
I'm going to get these people
into position for battle.

06:02.695 --> 06:06.282
Rhyno, you teach them
how to use the lightning staff.

06:06.365 --> 06:08.576
Okay, leave it to me.

06:08.659 --> 06:11.162
I won't disappoint you, Comrade Xylo.

06:11.746 --> 06:15.124
But there's something
I'd like to discuss with you.

06:15.208 --> 06:16.375
What?

06:17.168 --> 06:20.004
Let's decide which civilians die first.

06:20.088 --> 06:21.464
You...

06:21.547 --> 06:24.467
Surely, we should start
with the elderly, right?

06:24.550 --> 06:28.137
They've lived longer lives than children.

06:28.221 --> 06:29.806
It should be fairer if they die first--

06:29.889 --> 06:34.102
Who would agree to that
after hearing what you just said?

06:35.269 --> 06:37.730
Is this some kind of moral issue?

06:39.232 --> 06:44.153
Until the very end, we must take actions
that yield the best results.

06:44.737 --> 06:47.615
Only then can we assume
civilian casualties.

06:53.371 --> 06:55.414
Reinforcements have arrived.

06:55.498 --> 06:57.959
Xylo, you're still at it?

06:58.960 --> 07:00.294
You slowpoke.

07:01.003 --> 07:04.132
At this rate, I'll win again.

07:15.893 --> 07:18.938
Thank you for your help,
Comrade Jayce, Comrade Neely.

07:19.021 --> 07:21.941
I thank you on behalf
of all the stranded civilians.

07:22.024 --> 07:24.026
Shut up, idiot.

07:24.777 --> 07:27.280
So, Dotta, what's our next target?

07:27.363 --> 07:29.031
Ah, about that...

07:29.115 --> 07:30.491
There's a problem.

07:30.575 --> 07:33.244
A man in black armor
came out of that red tower...

07:35.746 --> 07:37.957
The artilleryman? Neely!

07:42.295 --> 07:44.338
It's a guided artillery shell.

07:44.422 --> 07:46.591
He won't be able to back us up now.

07:47.717 --> 07:50.678
Rhyno, Teoritta and I will seize Tui Jia.

07:50.761 --> 07:53.723
You and Tatsuya stay here
and defend the warehouse to the death.

07:54.307 --> 07:55.641
Got it.

07:55.725 --> 07:58.644
Let's work together
to overcome this challenge.

07:59.479 --> 08:04.484
After all, if you guys reject me,
there's no place for me in this world.

08:04.567 --> 08:05.735
No idea what you're talking about.

08:05.818 --> 08:07.111
That's creepy.

08:12.742 --> 08:13.951
Now then...

08:16.329 --> 08:17.455
Alright.

08:17.538 --> 08:20.666
It's time to show our bond and courage.

08:20.750 --> 08:22.627
Let the battle begin.

08:23.211 --> 08:26.255
For humanity's victory and peace!

08:27.548 --> 08:29.926
Oh... that was a surprise.

08:30.510 --> 08:34.138
That dragoon is quite skilled
to have dodged that attack.

08:34.222 --> 08:38.601
It's really troublesome to have
that dragon flying around.

08:38.684 --> 08:39.977
Iron Whale,

08:40.061 --> 08:42.188
try to stop its movements.

08:42.271 --> 08:45.816
Then you find a way to deal
with the approaching enemy.

08:45.900 --> 08:49.111
Artillerymen become vulnerable
once the enemy closes in.

08:49.195 --> 08:50.613
Besides,

08:50.696 --> 08:52.907
we're up against
the Goddess Killer, right?

08:52.990 --> 08:54.992
Yes, he's a strong enemy.

08:55.076 --> 08:56.827
He's worthy of respect.

08:58.120 --> 09:00.831
You're a strange one too.

09:00.915 --> 09:05.378
When you mentioned the Demon Blight,
I expected something far more vicious.

09:06.712 --> 09:08.464
There are many others like that.

09:09.048 --> 09:11.425
But I'm different.

09:11.509 --> 09:13.636
I don't hate humans.

09:14.136 --> 09:16.931
It's precisely because they're
the ones I'm about to destroy

09:17.014 --> 09:18.474
that I show them respect.

09:19.267 --> 09:23.437
In that sense, I don't like Spriggan.

09:23.521 --> 09:25.565
That guy lacks respect.

09:26.232 --> 09:31.988
Only my king can understand
the way I think.

09:32.071 --> 09:33.072
King?

09:33.698 --> 09:35.825
There's a king among the Demon Lords?

09:37.034 --> 09:39.579
Never mind, I've said too much.

09:39.662 --> 09:41.455
Let's stop talking about this.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.166
Then I won't ask anymore.

09:44.250 --> 09:48.921
In this line of work, the more you know,
the worse your death will be.

09:52.550 --> 09:55.011
The Goddess Killer is coming...

09:55.511 --> 09:58.973
Though I don't dislike humans like him,

10:00.391 --> 10:02.018
I have no choice but to kill him.

10:03.894 --> 10:07.565
Everything is for my king...

10:12.570 --> 10:14.113
Commander Kivia!

10:14.196 --> 10:15.865
The area
around the administrative building

10:15.948 --> 10:17.116
has been secured.

10:17.700 --> 10:19.910
What are your orders?

10:23.539 --> 10:24.957
Commander Kivia?

10:26.626 --> 10:30.254
I'm sorry, but the commanders on site
will have to decide.

10:30.338 --> 10:31.172
Huh?

10:32.632 --> 10:35.301
There's something I must do.

10:38.846 --> 10:41.432
I'm sorry,
but I can't disclose the details...

10:41.515 --> 10:42.767
Don't worry.

10:44.143 --> 10:48.814
I made up my mind long ago to stand by you
no matter what happens.

10:50.858 --> 10:53.277
It was the same back in Couveunge, right?

10:54.028 --> 10:58.699
After all, you're the one who taught me
how to wield a sword, Commander Kivia.

11:02.078 --> 11:03.704
I'm going back to my post.

11:05.039 --> 11:06.290
Rajit.

11:06.374 --> 11:07.333
Yes?

11:10.044 --> 11:13.506
On second thought, it's better
if you're the only one who knows.

11:14.465 --> 11:17.218
Just in case something happens to me.

11:23.891 --> 11:26.685
Comrade Xylo, I'm in position.

11:26.769 --> 11:28.604
Are the people in the warehouse all right?

11:28.687 --> 11:31.774
Yes, there's no problem with that.

11:32.358 --> 11:34.610
And we also have Comrade Tatsuya with us.

11:37.279 --> 11:40.449
I didn't expect him to be able
to use the lightning staff.

11:41.534 --> 11:45.329
I'm glad he's an ally of humanity.

11:46.205 --> 11:48.374
We should be grateful.

11:49.083 --> 11:51.085
Venetim, is Tsav not ready yet?

11:51.794 --> 11:54.046
I think it's going
to take a little longer.

11:54.130 --> 11:58.342
It seems like there are faeries
in the Inland District too.

11:58.426 --> 12:01.011
Teoritta, are you prepared for this?

12:01.095 --> 12:02.596
All right, let us do this.

12:02.680 --> 12:04.056
For humanity's sake!

12:05.433 --> 12:07.852
There's also a chance we'll die together.

12:07.935 --> 12:11.021
But unlike me, you only have one life.

12:14.650 --> 12:16.944
If you die, your memory will disappear.

12:17.027 --> 12:19.196
And all those memories
will vanish too, right?

12:19.989 --> 12:23.868
I will protect your memories.

12:24.452 --> 12:27.455
And all you have to do is protect my life.

12:29.081 --> 12:32.334
It's utterly foolish
to risk your life for someone else.

12:33.169 --> 12:35.796
But I'll show you.

12:38.132 --> 12:39.633
Let's go, Teoritta!

12:43.596 --> 12:46.807
Let's get this over with before sunrise
and get back to breakfast.

12:46.891 --> 12:49.101
I want zeff butter
and freshly baked bread.

12:49.185 --> 12:50.811
And onion soup.

12:50.895 --> 12:52.605
Plus perfectly cooked bacon.

12:52.688 --> 12:55.733
Those are very Goddess-like
and touching words.

12:55.816 --> 12:57.568
It's making me hungry!

13:03.491 --> 13:04.867
No problem.

13:04.950 --> 13:07.495
You're way faster
than that artillery strike.

13:07.578 --> 13:08.787
It won't hit you.

13:10.498 --> 13:13.042
You're way too slow, Xylo!

13:15.628 --> 13:16.629
Are you serious...?

13:19.340 --> 13:22.092
- My knight, is there another way?
- No.

13:23.636 --> 13:25.429
We have no choice but to go.

13:25.513 --> 13:26.514
Charge!

13:35.940 --> 13:36.982
Take this!

13:38.484 --> 13:39.860
My turn!

13:45.407 --> 13:47.117
Teoritta, charge forward!

13:51.372 --> 13:52.915
You're so persistent.

13:56.877 --> 13:57.962
Xylo...

13:58.045 --> 13:59.255
I'm fine.

14:00.047 --> 14:01.799
That's such a dirty trick.

14:01.882 --> 14:03.133
This is my job.

14:06.470 --> 14:08.222
This time, I'll fight for real.

14:12.101 --> 14:14.103
Iron Whale, flank him!

14:14.186 --> 14:16.105
Just don't hit me!

14:16.188 --> 14:18.524
Jeez, I'm so busy.

14:19.733 --> 14:21.443
Xylo, allow me!

14:26.073 --> 14:27.241
Where is she?

14:32.371 --> 14:33.747
Wha--

14:33.831 --> 14:34.915
Die!

14:34.999 --> 14:37.376
Teoritta, now!

14:38.919 --> 14:40.045
What--

14:45.050 --> 14:47.177
Hey, did you see that?

14:47.761 --> 14:48.929
Yeah!

14:49.013 --> 14:51.056
We can finish her with one blow now.

14:52.099 --> 14:53.517
Neely!

14:55.811 --> 14:57.104
Farewell.

15:05.446 --> 15:06.780
Damn it.

15:06.864 --> 15:08.866
It happened the moment
I let my guard down.

15:08.949 --> 15:11.368
Rhyno, you have a good aim, right?

15:11.911 --> 15:12.995
Of course.

15:13.704 --> 15:17.124
The calculations are complete,
and the enemy is distracted now.

15:18.751 --> 15:19.793
I'm going to destroy it.

15:23.213 --> 15:24.798
What... Artillery incoming!

15:29.595 --> 15:31.680
You've got to be kidding me...

15:34.141 --> 15:36.644
How's artillery like this even possible--

15:44.276 --> 15:47.196
How am I supposed to explain this...?

15:47.279 --> 15:49.865
My knight, the tower...

15:49.949 --> 15:51.909
Yes, this is part of the plan.

15:51.992 --> 15:53.077
We're going to fly!

15:57.998 --> 15:59.208
They're here...?

16:06.632 --> 16:08.467
This is the second time
you've asked me for a favor.

16:11.095 --> 16:13.931
Do you take a night-gaunt like me
for an intelligence officer?

16:14.014 --> 16:18.727
We're busy searching
for Demon Lord Spriggan now.

16:19.478 --> 16:21.772
I have to do whatever it takes.

16:22.272 --> 16:23.399
Please!

16:24.191 --> 16:27.277
I don't care what the price is,
but when the truth is revealed...

16:27.361 --> 16:28.946
I understand.

16:31.991 --> 16:34.118
I'll send you the investigation results
before tomorrow morning.

16:36.912 --> 16:38.205
I owe you one.

16:38.872 --> 16:40.708
I'm only doing this for Xylo,

16:40.791 --> 16:43.335
for the son-in-law
of the Mastibolt family.

16:46.922 --> 16:48.132
Besides,

16:48.716 --> 16:53.470
it wouldn't hurt me to have
the Holy Knights owe me a favor.

16:54.471 --> 16:55.806
If you'll excuse me.

17:03.814 --> 17:06.275
Now! Fire!

17:08.819 --> 17:11.947
- Second Echelon, advance!
- Your Majesty, the next wave is coming.

17:12.031 --> 17:14.908
The next wave is a bogie horde.
There are a lot of them.

17:14.992 --> 17:16.994
Shouldn't we run away?

17:17.077 --> 17:18.454
I won't allow it!

17:18.537 --> 17:21.582
If you dare take one step out of there,
I will have you executed.

17:21.665 --> 17:22.791
What...

17:22.875 --> 17:24.752
Make good use of your eyesight.

17:24.835 --> 17:28.172
Why do you think we gave you
Tsav's lightning staff?

17:29.423 --> 17:31.800
I can't use such a difficult weapon.

17:32.384 --> 17:34.845
Then at least hold your post at all costs.

17:34.928 --> 17:36.764
Tsav will be here soon.

17:36.847 --> 17:39.016
No, will he really come?

17:39.099 --> 17:41.435
- If I were him, I'd just run away.
- He'll come!

17:41.518 --> 17:44.063
That guy's a real scoundrel,

17:44.146 --> 17:46.774
but he's not the kind
who'd run away at a time like this.

17:46.857 --> 17:51.403
Are you implying I'm the kind of scoundrel
who'd run away in battle?

17:51.487 --> 17:53.697
- I used to think so as well.
- Huh?

17:53.781 --> 17:58.786
But your foolishness can
sometimes bring about miracles.

17:58.869 --> 18:01.413
That's what our commander in chief said.

18:01.997 --> 18:04.124
All we can do now is wait for victory.

18:04.208 --> 18:06.960
It is a king's duty to trust his subjects

18:07.044 --> 18:09.379
and wait patiently.

18:19.431 --> 18:21.141
Take this!

18:26.980 --> 18:29.566
Excellent reflexes.

18:30.859 --> 18:32.986
That exceeded my expectations.

18:33.070 --> 18:35.364
Xylo Forbartz.

18:40.285 --> 18:41.203
Blood?

18:41.286 --> 18:44.540
You're a formidable enemy.

18:47.334 --> 18:51.964
But if there's even the slightest chance
that I can kill the goddess,

18:52.840 --> 18:56.593
then it's worth... a try.

18:59.054 --> 19:00.180
What...

19:05.936 --> 19:07.062
I can't get close.

19:07.146 --> 19:08.939
Jayce, cover me.

19:09.022 --> 19:12.401
It's all blood and dust! I can't see!

19:12.985 --> 19:14.862
Is it okay if we burn you too?

19:14.945 --> 19:17.406
Tch, of course it's not...

19:19.241 --> 19:21.618
Rhyno, what are you waiting for?

19:21.702 --> 19:22.619
Hurry up and fire!

19:22.703 --> 19:26.081
Unfortunately,
I can't see from here, either.

19:26.165 --> 19:27.833
I'll have to recalculate.

19:28.417 --> 19:30.085
But don't worry.

19:30.169 --> 19:32.129
Either way, that tower will fall.

19:32.212 --> 19:34.590
Damn it, you useless bunch!

19:36.383 --> 19:38.677
Alright, I'll do it myself.

19:57.446 --> 19:59.281
This guy...

20:00.782 --> 20:01.909
Xylo!

20:01.992 --> 20:03.911
I've immobilized you.

20:04.494 --> 20:05.829
Right here...

20:05.913 --> 20:07.289
I'll kill you.

20:07.956 --> 20:10.250
The Goddess Teoritta...

20:11.919 --> 20:13.587
Only you...

20:14.671 --> 20:18.133
I must kill you at all costs.

20:22.346 --> 20:25.724
Teoritta, don't make that face.

20:26.516 --> 20:31.438
Trust your knight
and show that proud attitude.

20:32.856 --> 20:36.443
Believe that I'm invincible.

20:37.152 --> 20:39.279
Xylo Forbartz!

21:02.261 --> 21:03.428
What?

21:03.512 --> 21:04.930
Time's up,

21:05.013 --> 21:06.640
Boojum.

21:10.644 --> 21:12.354
I see...

21:13.105 --> 21:15.315
But it's not over...

21:16.942 --> 21:19.444
It's not over yet!

21:23.657 --> 21:26.159
- Xylo, you are hurt...
- Don't worry about it.

21:39.423 --> 21:40.882
Things look good.

21:47.931 --> 21:49.349
I've been...

21:50.767 --> 21:53.186
through a battle like this before...

21:55.814 --> 21:57.065
Once again...

21:57.983 --> 21:58.942
XYLO

22:02.779 --> 22:04.031
FOR MY SAKE TOO...

22:05.490 --> 22:07.576
- How much longer can my body hold?
- What about Teoritta's stamina?

22:07.659 --> 22:09.494
- The next strike will decide the winner.
- Watch Boojum's movements.

22:09.578 --> 22:11.580
- I won't lose.
- Hero is a meaningless title.

22:11.663 --> 22:13.498
For their sake...

22:14.583 --> 22:16.877
This time, I must...

22:18.837 --> 22:20.339
succeed!

22:20.922 --> 22:21.715
Excellent.

22:29.723 --> 22:32.768
Amazing, Xylo Forbartz.

22:33.643 --> 22:38.190
Your deeds will surely
become a heroic epic.

22:38.774 --> 22:41.818
If only I could witness it...

22:42.527 --> 22:45.447
However, precisely because of that,

22:45.530 --> 22:48.742
I will use everything
I have to defeat you.

22:49.242 --> 22:50.869
Spiraling Blood!

22:54.998 --> 22:58.668
- My knight, you must not miss.
- Alright.

23:01.546 --> 23:04.424
With this, it all ends.

23:09.054 --> 23:11.139
Only one strike left.

23:12.057 --> 23:13.642
We can do it, right?

23:13.725 --> 23:17.104
Of course. Even if I have to force you,

23:17.187 --> 23:19.189
I will make sure you complete the mission.

23:21.108 --> 23:22.359
You've got some nerve saying that.

23:23.360 --> 23:28.156
For my king, I demand your death!

23:37.499 --> 23:41.128
Xylo Forbartz!

23:45.799 --> 23:50.345
Is this... the world-ending Holy Sword?

23:55.433 --> 24:00.021
Nothing is indestructible
before the Holy Sword.
